# Red Star 'M'pire

id:polity-red-star-mpire a oa:Polity ;
    skos:prefLabel "Red Star 'M'pire" ;
    oa:ambiguousName false ;
    oa:color "#BF3000" ;
    oa:editorialNote "Encyclopaedia timeline, 9550: seedships launched \"to mark the 5,000th anniversary of\nthe founding of the Red Star 'M'pire\" — so 4550, by subtraction rather than\nby a line that names the year.\nDeep red for a red-star empire, 16.5 from its nearest, which is TRHN.\nNot a volume like the others: its cells were grown along a tidal streamer\nof the Sagittarius Dwarf, so it should read as a filament steeply\ninclined to the disk rather than a sphere. Nothing is drawn for that\nshape yet — one recorded place cannot outline it." ;
    oa:foundedAT 4550 ;
    oa:hasSource src:eg-system-articles ;
    oa:kind "meta-empire" ;
    oa:polityId "red-star-mpire" ;
    oa:recordOrder 46 ;
    oa:uncertain false .
